    │                                                                      │
────│   ── Navigation ──────────────────────────────────────────────────   │────
    │   j k  move row selection                                            │
  NE│   g G  top / bottom                                                  │    
   ◆│   tab  next session that needs you                                   │  4m
    │   1-4  jump to Needs you / Waiting / Working / Done (4 also folds    │
